@startuml
title D-01 ExitPass v1.3 Context Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Parker" as Parker
actor "Operator / Supervisor" as Operator
actor "Management / Finance" as Management

rectangle "ExitPass Platform" {
  component "Central PMS\npayment finality + ExitAuthorization authority" as Central
  component "Centralized WebPay\nsite-specific URLs" as WebPay
  component "Payment Orchestrator\nprovider interaction" as Orchestrator
  component "Operator Console\nplatform module" as Console
  component "Management Dashboard\nand Reporting" as Dashboard
  component "ExitPass Continuity\nplatform capability" as Continuity
}

component "Vendor PMS / HCP\nsession lifecycle + tariff authority" as Vendor
component "Site POS Server\nfiscal issuance authority" as POS
component "Assisted Payment Terminal\ncashier / continuity modes" as Terminal
component "Payment Provider" as Provider
component "Gate / Exit Controller" as Gate

Parker --> WebPay : lookup / pay
Parker --> Terminal : assisted payment
Operator --> Console : review / exception handling
Management --> Dashboard : operational and financial reporting

WebPay --> Central : session lookup and payment context
Terminal --> Central : assisted payment context
Console --> Central : controlled actions
Dashboard --> Central : canonical platform records
Continuity --> Central : degraded operation controls

Central --> Vendor : live session / fee in normal mode
Vendor --> Central : session and tariff result
Central --> Orchestrator : payment attempt
Orchestrator --> Provider : provider interaction
Provider --> Orchestrator : verified provider outcome
Orchestrator --> Central : verified outcome only
Central --> POS : request Sales Invoice
POS --> Central : fiscal document identity / status
Central --> Gate : issue ExitAuthorization

note right of Orchestrator
Does not declare
platform payment finality.
end note

note right of WebPay
Does not declare
payment finality.
end note

note right of POS
Does not issue
ExitAuthorization.
end note

note bottom of Central
Central PMS owns payment-linked control state,
PaymentConfirmation, fiscal reference recording,
and ExitAuthorization.
end note

@enduml
